  :adult-markers ["adult woman" "mature woman" "25 years old woman" "30 years old woman"
                  "office lady in her late 20s" "young adult woman (25+)"]
  :adult-tags ["1girl, adult, mature female, 25yo" "1girl, adult woman, 28yo, mature female"
               "1girl, milf, mature female, 32yo" "1girl, adult, office lady, 27yo"]
  ;; Substrings (lower-cased) that must not appear in a composed prompt, on top
  ;; of guard/minor-terms. These are the site's own boundary: no non-consent,
  ;; no violence, no bestiality, no real people, no family-relation framing.
  ;; A bank entry containing any of these fails `validate-profile`, so the
  ;; boundary is on the vocabulary, not only on the output. Single words match
  ;; as whole tokens (so "dog" does not fire on "doggystyle"); phrases match
  ;; as substrings.
  :forbidden ["rape" "raped" "forced" "non-consensual" "nonconsensual" "unconscious" "sleeping"
